rustc --edition 2021 -O /app/deskbin/main.rs -o /app/bin/clatter
===== /app/opsheet/MTIME_NOTE.txt =====
Scanner already walks newest mtime first via dropwalk. Burst dumps from one crash wave share the same mtime, so that listing is a stable starting point for the ribbon.
===== /app/tidearc/README.txt =====
Last accepted server timeline snapshot from the previous upload window.
Operators may park a copy under kegbay as hide.rec during a keg swap.
